.el .ds Aq '
.TH teamtype-join 1  "join 0.9.2 (e05a26724 2026-07-08)" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
teamtype\-join \- Join a shared directory via a join code, or connect to the most recent one
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBteamtype join\fR [\fB\-\-sync\-vcs\fR] [\fB\-\-magic\-wormhole\-relay\fR] [\fB\-\-iroh\-relay\fR] [\fB\-\-directory\fR] [\fB\-\-iroh\-dns\-domain\fR] [\fB\-\-iroh\-pkarr\-relay\fR] [\fB\-\-username\fR] [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-temporary\-directory\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIJOIN_CODE\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Join a shared directory via a join code, or connect to the most recent one
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-sync\-vcs\fR
EXPERIMENTAL: Also synchronize version\-control directories like .git/ or .jj/, which are normally ignored. For Git, this will synchronize all branches, commits, etc. as well as your .git/config. This means that new commits will immediately appear at all peers, you can change branches together, etc
.TP
\fB\-\-magic\-wormhole\-relay\fR \fI<MAGIC_WORMHOLE_RELAY>\fR
Use an alternative Magic Wormhole mailbox server relay url
.TP
\fB\-\-iroh\-relay\fR \fI<IROH_RELAY>\fR
Use an alternative Iroh relay url
.TP
\fB\-\-directory\fR \fI<DIRECTORY>\fR
The shared directory. Defaults to current directory
.TP
\fB\-\-iroh\-dns\-domain\fR \fI<IROH_DNS_DOMAIN>\fR
Use an alternative Iroh DNS origin domain
.TP
\fB\-\-iroh\-pkarr\-relay\fR \fI<IROH_PKARR_RELAY>\fR
Use an alternative Iroh Pkarr relay server
.TP
\fB\-\-username\fR \fI<USERNAME>\fR
The name that others see next to your cursor. Defaults to your Git username
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-temporary\-directory\fR
Create a new temporary directory and use it as the shared directory. The temporary directory is removed on exit. The temporary directory is created in `$XDG_CACHE_DIR/teamtype/`, or if `XDG_CACHE_DIR` is not set in `$HOME/.cache/teamtype/`, or if `HOME` is not set in `/home/$USER/.cache/teamtype/`
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIJOIN_CODE\fR]
Specify to connect to a new peer. Otherwise, try to connect to the most recent peer
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v0.9.2 (e05a26724 2026\-07\-08)
